<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's total vehicle sales up 42 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's total vehicle sales up 42 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian total vehicle sales rose 42 percent in October this year to 39,440 units from 27,776 in October 1995, the Malaysian Motor Traders' Association (MMTA) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sales of passenger cars, including four-wheel-drive vehicles for private use, rose 38.5 percent in October 1996 to 31,132 units from 22,484 units a year ago, according to the latest figures obtained from the MMTA.</p>
</text>
